abstract: >-
  Educational and research-oriented, hardware-aware Windows bootstrap and reproducible
  configuration layer for AUTOMATIC1111 applied to architectural visualization. A0 STABLE
  freezes clean installation, hardware detection, profile selection, profile-aware UI defaults,
  verified model manifests, ControlNet baseline and real generation smoke tests.
